{
  "short_id": "short296",
  "episode_id": "PD-2026-074-itaewon",
  "voice_stage": "master",
  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.284,
  "total_seconds": 54.3,
  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-074-itaewon\\06_voice\\master\\short296_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "One square metre is a doormat. Nine people. On a doormat.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.39,
      "seconds": 3.39,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:823615c6f8ada828fe766cd1a336020c53baeb03d4aedcabf12e4fc2d930bdb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "Four researchers published a study of that night. They put the average density during the crush at seven point five seven people per square metre.",
      "start": 3.61,
      "end": 11.505,
      "seconds": 7.895,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:0088e27643db090fcaf4ca55e3f98298a4314816b9bdb7bdb3ffdaa5b619aa21"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "The street is about fifty metres long. At the top it is about five metres wide. At the bottom it is three point two.",
      "start": 11.725,
      "end": 18.598,
      "seconds": 6.873,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:58d97e2f3dae51c94b97203f3696117685f70df300db210973f75ead271d34f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The street slopes. That direction matters more than any number would, because it decides which way the weight goes.",
      "start": 18.818,
      "end": 25.18,
      "seconds": 6.362,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:0f9579ac2a5f22780a038f5a924c8c165e79e6dac4ab8ea2ee80f98afae60352"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The alley was full in both directions: people coming up from the bottom, and people coming down from the top.",
      "start": 25.4,
      "end": 31.159,
      "seconds": 5.759,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:fa03e5ed45d881ea0973b16eca5ecc4fee6fcff4d88e8fb4cd9a2d38e84925eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "A crowd on flat ground has one thing going for it: the pressure has somewhere to go, in every direction at once. A crowd being fed into a passage from both ends has none.",
      "start": 31.379,
      "end": 41.456,
      "seconds": 10.077,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:b6a76a1bd975a975fd687a75acf31728d50c50e8b86c7d786ee1e1a748fc97e4"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "At the density those researchers measured, a person cannot lift their arms. The direction they travel is decided by the people behind them.",
      "start": 41.676,
      "end": 49.339,
      "seconds": 7.663,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:17d3f14fdae98f714d5c233eb955e4842ab673dcf0fa065d10304ceee943d7f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "At the same headcount, a narrow sloping alley is a different kind of place from a wide flat one.",
      "start": 49.559,
      "end": 54.296,
      "seconds": 4.737,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:784af666ac698b655273c6d64dadebe94b4abeae99edff3f02caa34078d57f78"
    }
  ]
}
